            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hangi satır bir f-string başlatır?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>f\"Level {level}\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"f Level {level}\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>f = \"Level {level}\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>f\"Level {level}\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
